## 6. Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| Event spam impacting performance | Low | Events opt-in only; no default logging |
| Feature bloat in `InlineEditingFeature` | Medium | Keep hooks thin; consider DI-based observer to avoid extra parameters |
| UX duplication | Low | Reuse existing validation panels where possible |

